0..53 Comment "//! Law 3 moves a lifted substitution past weakening."
54..57 Comment "//!"
58..115 Comment "//! `sub(sub(b, p), lift(s))` equals `sub(sub(b, s), p)`."
116..119 Comment "//!"
120..195 Comment "//! The law does not hold by direct computation. An induction on `b` proves"
196..251 Comment "//! the law. The proof compares lookups at every index."
252..255 Comment "//!"
256..271 Comment "//! - see: #640"
